{"posts":[{"id":"engulf_p11_251","t":"salivan\n\n7. combination again","a":"—","d":"","n":"#251","p":11,"im":["9e6785db8575dde093cbf11fdb1d45ea1fc3adf3"],"m":251},{"id":"engulf_p11_252","t":"HI everyone here is my first attempt on this thread i found a good area to trade short in GBP/JPY H4 and i went to lower TFs to see any signals to enter the trade\n\nin H1 i found a new FTR\n\nthere was a beautiful FL and FTR in the first return to it\n\nfinally im M15 i could find a good confirmation to go short\n\nany comments are appreciated","a":"—","d":"","n":"#252","p":11,"im":["29c0b9cbfae6120d70266923003699ff0a5d2628","a92b0d537f3fea2f714a3cc8e1383896c3d0d5be","3a1d3b9731d12542fab3f030b2ffdb230051c5ec","66f4fe83f9282e498eb4486a0627fbbff18f7f86"],"m":252},{"id":"engulf_p11_253","t":"salivan\n\nhey GUNNER glad to see you here mate if you don't mind i wrote some note for you hope it helps you keep up the good work here,this thread is the most part of reading the market in my idea.\n\n6867\n\nwith regards SALIVAN","a":"—","d":"","n":"#253","p":11,"im":["d7bf2bfd9a10cfb2499cb32bd14560fba66bfd6a"],"m":253},{"id":"engulf_p11_254","t":"salivan\n\nI POSTED THIS ONE TO \"THE ART OF WAR THREAD\" but it is really nice for here too. This one is the one that really interested me in those DPs that have the most value some times we see that there are some H/L that price didn't ENGULF them but they will be ignored by a rally or drop easily why??? and how?? in this instance we have a nice one.\n\n6867\n\nin following charts i want to find the reason behind price movement as IF told us: all the market is DP. but in my idea some DPs are the most important one. as i suppose that all that spikes are deals.and in these spikes some SLs hit some TPs hit,a deal occur then the starts of decision for next target is where ITs start to ENGULF some barrier in their way( in this case down )\n\nnow i want to find the DP for my long position\n\nand you can see that there is a reason behind price. this is how i read the market and it was really magic for me.this kind of reading the chart will tell you why ENGULF form hope it helps you. SALIVAN","a":"—","d":"","n":"#254","p":11,"im":["7f833a0208a1f3548f2ab99a501ae6e48a81c7f8","14f4e9db0ba53558f720715f7d608f871237bfb8","6cff4e49944b6ace7d37fa2093aab24039092716"],"m":254},{"id":"engulf_p11_255","t":"salivan\n\nhow to read the ITs how they tell to each other that the price turn soon by ENGULF engulf tell them that be ready for next RALLY OR DROP\n\ndid they ENGULF each other?? yes why not. they have to ENGULF each other (it's better to say that they have to ENG their prior DECISIONS ) if price wants to turn. here is an EX hope it helps you.\n\n6867\n\nSALIVAN","a":"—","d":"","n":"#255","p":11,"im":["5f966d4e04fbef33cbe878e9d5ca532ccddd0408"],"m":255},{"id":"engulf_p11_256","t":"HI again i tried to open a trade using engulf concept in first picture i found a good area to trade on NZD/CHF H4\n\nin H1 it appears that many of the market moves was controlled by the ENGULF and also FTRs..... i didn't have my confirmation to enter yet\n\nin M15 i got my confirmation finally details are on the picture","a":"—","d":"","n":"#256","p":11,"im":["62ce003a61fd817701f52329f0a9cce906601dba","3173d7c59a83b063987eb4117414565013d709e6","dbd5aa8b639834711177f0bf509e2ac6a8914e3b"],"m":256},{"id":"engulf_p11_257","t":"engulf & reactions to DPs.....","a":"—","d":"","n":"#257","p":11,"im":["d11d82a6b486df6e776d13afed1f9f89284d6cb6"],"m":257},{"id":"engulf_p11_258","t":"trading the FTR on AUD/USD h4 using engulf concept\n\nhere is the reaction to that level\n\nGUNNER","a":"—","d":"","n":"#258","p":11,"im":["a25ae5015a9f2179af7037194d4564cfbfb2471b","ffcff304b14d5edbefbf2628eefec808d991b9b9","a76c27be187fd0ef732b016b02b0fa6b6a92bb24","0ef9670873684cd00b52337581da365109d122e6"],"m":258},{"id":"engulf_p11_259","t":"engulf concept reaction to the source of engulf\n\nGUNNER","a":"—","d":"","n":"#259","p":11,"im":["e9d16274bce537ff47b7fdef69d1c4dcd05